OL,3,GNEWSACharity thanks inmates for work to
OL,4,Asave hedgehogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity has thanked prison
OL,7,Finmates for helping to save hedgehogs'
OL,8,Flives.
OL,10,FPrisoners in HMP La Moye, in St
OL,11,FBrelade, have given Jersey Hedgehog
OL,12,FPreservation Group 20 feeding and
OL,13,Fnesting boxes which they have made out
OL,14,Fof reclaimed pallet timber.
OL,16,FPeter Gould, the prison's vocational
OL,17,Fmanager, said the work could help
OL,18,Freduce reoffending because it taught
OL,19,Finmates skills to support future
OL,20,Femployment and helped them feel they
OL,21,Fwere contributing to the community.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
