OL,3,GNEWSACharity thanks inmates for work to
OL,4,Asave hedgehogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FDru Burdon, from the hedgehog group,
OL,7,Fsaid: "If it helps with carpentry
OL,8,Fskills training, so much the better,
OL,9,Fthese boxes are certainly saving
OL,10,Fhedgehogs' lives."
